      "text": {
        "arText": "فَذَٰلِكَ الَّذِي يَدُعُّ الْيَتِيمَ",
        "enText": "For that is the one who drives away the orphan",
        "enTextTransliteration": "Fa zaalikal lazi yadu'ul-yateem",
        "bnText": "সে সেই ব্যক্তি, যে এতীমকে গলা ধাক্কা দেয়",
        "bntextLatin": "se se'i byakti, ye etimake gala dhakka deya"
      },
