      "text": {
        "arText": "وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ الْمِسْكِينِ",
        "enText": "And does not encourage the feeding of the poor.",
        "enTextTransliteration": "Wa la ya huddu 'alaa ta'amil miskeen",
        "bnText": "এবং মিসকীনকে অন্ন দিতে উৎসাহিত করে না।",
        "bntextLatin": "ebam misakinake anna dite utsahita kare na."
      },
